{"data": [{"author_id": "823789739975114752", "created_at": "2026-11-01T10:35:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116841648726643003"], "id": "2116841648726643003", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 9535, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "说个暴论：\n现在AI模型发展已经到了瓶颈，A社融资规模从300亿减少到200亿\n\nAI发展进入去泡沫期，现在应该更多的是反思和沉淀\n\n理性的做法应该是探索下沉市场，而不是继续追风口", "url": "https://x.com/nieerai_dev/status/2116841648726643003"}, {"author_id": "1938063797098582019", "created_at": "2026-11-01T06:36:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116781512628764972"], "id": "2116781512628764972", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 164, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116780651601076365", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "股市反映收入\n不制造收入\n主水管放在国债和社融\n汇金只负责别让撤离变成踩踏\n两万亿拿去充指数\n会把这两件事都做坏\n中国不是日本\n日本常年0息 还有美元可以错配\n日本央行无限弹药跟你不是一回事\n你把贝森特现在放在潘功胜的位置\n他也不可能给你干2w亿进去拉高股市\n换谁来都不会 https://t.co/6w0Gtq4d8C", "url": "https://x.com/WGiordanol66/status/2116781512628764972"}, {"author_id": "1938063797098582019", "created_at": "2026-11-01T12:24:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116868911526469754"], "id": "2116868911526469754", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 439, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2109613901319168465", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "其实最根本是第3条背后的那件事：\n中央用人民币把债发出去\n花成工资和国内订单\n社融和M2跟着这笔收入一起涨没有这一条\n回购\n外资\n离岸美元\n居民补仓\n都只是在换手\n有第三条这个推动器\n那些钱才是来确认的\n不是来当发动机的\n他们只是确认行情逐利的\n药引子还是第三条\n发动机不推🔥现在就是歇B over\n歇🔥 https://t.co/HaQ1zWkf6k", "url": "https://x.com/WGiordanol66/status/2116868911526469754"}, {"author_id": "1938063797098582019", "created_at": "2026-11-01T06:19:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116777208505413826"], "id": "2116777208505413826", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 159, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116775518070837451", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "人民币往股市里充值没用\n越充值越烂\n因为纯粹的是空转\n救市可以\n救市不是帮你解套是维护市场稳定跟有序撤离\n便宜了之后极度便宜一定有人会买\n外汇储备的账 谁都不清楚\n手里拿着美元还要稳定汇率还要买东西还要应对突发性事件\n中央汇金有多少笔钱一定是按审批预算扶持的\n主要还要靠非银跟社融还有债市 https://t.co/gNMGLXLvqd", "url": "https://x.com/WGiordanol66/status/2116777208505413826"}, {"author_id": "1912797175907840000", "created_at": "2026-10-31T19:33:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116614558530011481"], "id": "2116614558530011481", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5198, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "【整理中】Arbor Realty Trust、現金7億ドルを見込む一方で古い融資を毎四半期4億〜5億ドル片づける計画ｗｗｗ\n\n株主「現金積むんか。ええやん」\n会社「融資の整理も進めるで」\n株主「どのくらいや」\n\n・第1四半期の終わりに現金7億ドルを見込む ← 手元資金を厚くする予定。", "url": "https://x.com/FukuroStocks/status/2116614558530011481"}, {"author_id": "1994097255335534592", "created_at": "2026-10-31T13:35:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116524339738952127"], "id": "2116524339738952127", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "[热点]｜中国｜来源：新华财经 + 央行\n央行将每个工作日开展隔夜逆回购\n\n中文正文：", "url": "https://x.com/yqi1089863/status/2116524339738952127"}, {"article": {"title": "GDP增长不等于股市回报：2005—2025年中美股市与资金流向比较"}, "author_id": "93798009", "created_at": "2026-10-31T13:47:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116527427992289620"], "id": "2116527427992289620", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/HzBChuy2Wj", "url": "https://x.com/davidlu1709/status/2116527427992289620"}, {"author_id": "1739107949166137344", "created_at": "2026-11-01T10:39:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116842481685803321"], "id": "2116842481685803321", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0