ck buyback relending loan.", "url": "https://x.com/macro_fengshui/status/2116874321809269243"}, {"author_id": "364720480", "created_at": "2026-11-01T16:02:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116923889745846338"], "id": "2116923889745846338", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 81, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "El PBOC, la CSRC y la NFRA de China se reúnen el 2 de noviembre de 2026 para analizar herramientas de apoyo al mercado de capitales, entre ellas optimizar y ampliar el uso de la facilidad de relending para recompras de acciones y aumentos de participaciones. https://t.co/R22WZePt1F", "url": "https://x.com/cacus/status/2116923889745846338"}, {"author_id": "704718154627457029", "created_at": "2026-11-01T16:47:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116935294888952014", "2116935931840356649"], "id": "2116935294888952014", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 313, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116805150698319889", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "I love how investors dismiss the PBOC put\n😂🙃\nNever, Ever underestimate the ability of a central bank to pump and inflate \"stuff\" with elastic money. https://t.co/TuP6kX4XQI", "url": "https://x.com/GraphCall/status/2116935294888952014"}, {"author_id": "2033221498702647296", "created_at": "2026-11-01T07:10:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116789872635920732"], "id": "2116789872635920732", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Gold Pulls Back to $4,010 as the PBoC Buys a 23rd Straight Month: Spot eased to $4,010.​80 late Thursday after trading above $4,120 earlier in the week, but the official sector kept buying: the PBoC added 23 tonnes in September, its biggest month since October… dlvr.​it/TW7rPs https://t.co/5B7PBwskWN", "url": "https: